stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PendingVerification: POST /api/register (user_type=Customer)
    PendingVerification --> Active: email_verified_at set
    Active --> Banned: manager sets ban=true, ban_date recorded
    Banned --> Active: manager sets ban=false, ban_date cleared
    Active --> [*]
    note right of Banned
        security checks ban status at the door;
        banned customers cannot open new orders
    end note
